recommend check-in (Keaton) -- the records are back and the mechanism is booked, yet 29 stashed files still wait, one of them a repair with a row already written. Two questions want your word: whether a lap's open should refuse over a stash holding an absent log, and whether the stash should be read back at all rather than merely reported. Your %387 asks the neighbouring half. Meanwhile my own lane's %451 classifier still waits on BAKERY.
